==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
from the British physicist [[w:Peter Higgs|Peter Higgs]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Higgs]] [[boson]]}}

# {{particles}} A [[hypothetical]] [[elementary particle]] predicted by the [[Standard Model]]; a [[boson]] with [[zero]] [[spin]], it is thought to give [[mass]] to other [[particle]]s.

====Derived terms====
* [[Higgsino]]

====Related terms====
